id: demon-person-genes
name: Demon Person Genes
order: 1
optionOf: demon-genes
optionEffect: 5
description: >
  Increase the Natural Result of the 1d10 rolled for the 1st effect of Demon Genes by 1 (after being rolled), unless the Natural Result is 1.
text: >
  Demon Person Genes [Passive]: Increase the Natural Result of the 1d10 rolled for the 1st effect of Demon Genes by 1 (after being rolled), unless the Natural Result is 1.

---

# Read by Demon Genes' roll (chat.mjs demonGenesRoll).
[passive]
allow demonGenes.person;
